    "DefaultText": "Cast Copper Rivet (old)"
  },
  "CardDescription": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_copper_rivet",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_CopperRivet_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A Cast Copper Rivet from before Water-Driven Infrastructure switched to the shared Metal Nail of CSFFModFramework. Within a quarter of an hour it becomes a Copper Nail (a Metal Nail of copper, Metal Type 100) by itself; Reforge as Metal Nail does it at once. Nothing makes this card any more."
  },
  "CardHelpSection": {
    "ParentObjectID": "water_sawmill_copper_rivet",
    "LocalizationKey": "Water_Sawmill_CopperRivet_CardHelpSection",
    "DefaultText": "<b>Retired:</b> Water-Driven Infrastructure no longer makes its own Cast Copper Rivet. Every WDI recipe now takes the shared Metal Nail, the one CSFFModFramework ships for all mods. This old card turns into a Copper Nail (a Metal Nail of copper, Metal Type 100) by itself within a quarter of an hour, or at once with Reforge as Metal Nail."
  },
